98	12	21	21 \n \nsummary, the Gantt chart will illustrate an outline of the systematized stepwise procedure, which \nis vital for the timeliness of the delivery process. \nF. Project Organization:  \n1. Project Organization Chart: \n \n2. Organization Description: \nThe project team is established to deal with all the technical requirement of the system and \nensure that there is a definite chain of command. \n \nComposition: To address the technical specifications of the project, the team of five people was \nstructured based on their experience in areas of Artificial Intelligence, Graph Database Theory, \nSoftware Engineering and User Experience Design.	2026-07-31 03:34:14.786742
