237	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	69	document_chunk	1	This capstone project proposes the development of a web-based Decision Support System for a \nsimulated college environment that addresses these limitations through the integration of \nKnowledge Graphs and Retrieval-Augmented Generation. Organizational entities such as \ndepartments, strategies, actions, constraints, and outcomes are represented within a Knowledge \nGraph to preserve relationships and historical context. Structured decision data is stored in a \nrelational SQL database, while unstructured textual content is encoded as vector embeddings to \nenable semantic retrieval. A chat interface allows users to interact with the system using natural \nlanguage, with queries dynamically retrieving relevant information from multiple data sources to \nproduce grounded and context-aware responses.	[0.0123157175,0.057063352,-0.16864656,-0.05733355,0.07319365,-0.01812391,-0.007905664,-0.004519494,-0.00072846847,0.0018339022,0.03736695,0.013711096,0.10074351,-0.0029235785,-0.038391482,-6.840447e-05,-0.070006184,-0.037646063,-0.03769829,0.02860215,-0.0008260723,-0.029249534,-0.040324677,-0.008067997,0.027942702,0.016659664,-0.012511532,-0.019470895,-0.06810173,0.023133209,0.018401913,0.060161658,0.03305528,-0.0200195,-0.09061941,-0.06532277,0.032086905,-0.0066604456,0.0014228319,0.0005334801,0.00065565674,0.017828349,-0.00028839544,-0.07333077,0.0446411,0.0017837274,0.041116897,-0.044305544,0.07004554,-0.014653681,-0.0058060857,-0.011500487,-0.013484165,0.01893757,0.05867551,0.026993787,0.013708491,0.044234615,0.03922234,-0.08533728,0.12723108,0.09294232,-0.0395117,0.06429527,0.044283148,-0.017270429,-0.063591756,0.07559081,-0.044076998,-0.020959113,0.035575025,0.015639506,0.045618977,0.02015253,-0.040442158,0.004709555,-0.020018553,-0.029514944,-0.00769996,0.06878224,0.030000698,-0.028191967,0.056502476,-0.030964838,0.04181386,0.03771165,-0.038854126,-0.009061257,0.024703402,0.06569004,0.0076480573,0.03459451,0.026826646,0.00806