245	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	72	document_chunk	1	1.2.6 Data Warehouse and Business Intelligence–Based DSS \nOne other option for enabling analytics scalability and practical use is data warehousing -based \nDSS architecture. Created in 2021, it relies on data from independent educational marts. It's a \ndata-centric DSS that leverages business intelligence reporting and trend-analysis tools. This \npaper has shown that decision support systems (DSS) that are backed by well-designed data \nwarehouses can be trusted to be useful in schools and other learning environments.( (Hamoud, et \nal., 2021) \n1.3 Limitations of Traditional Decision Support Systems	[-0.01723597,0.06056502,-0.17252909,-0.019243766,0.06385727,-0.019613767,0.034265585,0.041425213,-0.00053097523,-0.035546824,0.0325908,0.02499415,0.1352022,-0.0036040293,-0.02910072,-0.0060959565,-0.09358182,-0.028433252,-0.028626569,0.022678351,-0.019255547,-0.0723941,-0.048175775,-0.028208043,0.04866838,0.0002848826,0.002978812,0.0017526813,0.009225488,0.01568223,0.009969358,0.02293058,0.061319843,-0.0031072597,-0.05628421,-0.045656316,0.0014774824,-0.025447117,-0.0017239297,-0.025060233,-0.013442925,0.002743404,-0.004367807,-0.058362257,0.068790816,0.02440528,0.03314468,-0.035965208,0.11150719,0.007867498,-0.009296656,-0.034061037,0.0056076776,0.023456387,0.058880787,-0.010086756,-0.022697542,0.03313427,0.0068815495,-0.0601525,0.097400256,0.08815594,-0.042437613,0.05606476,0.0592241,-0.020179486,-0.03912971,0.017066864,-0.030136243,-0.065259404,0.059073467,-0.005195625,0.053495113,-0.00654295,-0.007997628,0.04380603,-0.026475923,-0.030347524,-0.074534334,0.071867794,0.032592554,-0.038907748,0.054356813,-0.03707799,0.047633987,0.02828648,-0.014253041,0.008391769,0.017327001,0.052044075,0.0021135178,0.03823944,0.049043514,0.025482126,-0.04611012,0.056582917,-0.052855637,-0.010883082,-0.016588697,-0.02965949,-0.05023662,-0.037362847,-0.00218326,-0.025157407,0.0334823,0.013481335,0.017131092,0.0051814206,-0.0374355,-0.01149135,-