251	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	74	document_chunk	1	1.5 Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Grounded Responses \nLarge language models often generate inaccurate information when they lack domain-specific \nknowledge. RAG addresses this by retrieving relevant information from external sources before \ngenerating responses (Lewis, 2020).This method bases the result on real data as compared to \nsimply relying on the training of the model. Nevertheless, conventional RAG recovers separate \ntext fragments, depending on their similarity, whereas the connection between chunks of \ninformation is absent. . (Gao, 2023).	[0.035700243,0.03998924,-0.19737846,-0.0976412,0.07588536,0.03220936,0.044653933,0.060684603,0.008261913,-0.032593686,0.016599862,-0.002161763,0.0850525,0.046626292,-0.04421473,-0.030216493,0.02448416,-0.04950581,-0.049074754,0.040683415,-0.009187755,-0.03881991,0.004906635,-0.0055269725,0.033425458,-0.027985157,-0.031732205,-0.027553467,-0.053610362,0.008216761,0.012564864,-0.034734014,-0.012505999,-0.03129235,-0.052435257,0.016051296,0.021858362,0.032082796,-0.012758412,0.01656881,0.04338107,0.00040544875,0.035386756,-0.015654225,0.0421648,-0.012173353,0.065071166,0.0040492006,0.053156614,-0.09323749,0.02111282,-0.0111380555,0.0063310675,-0.00022202833,0.06828001,0.009169901,-0.04123265,0.007679238,0.03524731,-0.045005184,0.0885593,0.071781315,-0.09831508,0.048318658,0.006486063,-0.018492345,-0.04442956,0.04962505,-0.0075295623,-0.05589044,0.04828055,0.004611957,-0.00034471366,0.043920286,-0.06327169,-0.00096156896,-0.05184125,-0.030234372,-0.01897583,0.05051241,0.022155838,-0.0052651763,0.041474946,-0.0015608651,0.061525874,0.02172258,-0.00029547518,0.045604467,-0.015602149,0.07299973,0.022253152,-0.014839215,0.061003633,0.013875964,-0.09694408,0.058740683,-0.03454092,0.019006941,-0.04963142,-0.030628478,-0.03490444,0.018139385,0.023158096,-0.018361831,0.02346385,0.048369788,0.037804235,0.002007538,-0.0115025025,-0.012879554,-0.043162614,0.048393633,-0.0017218989,-0.03