257	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	74	document_chunk	4	1.7 Educational & Domain-Specific KG-RAG Systems \nThe application of KG-RAG in domain-specific systems and instructional systems has also been \nexamined in other recent works. When responding to academic inquiries, the application of KG-\nRAG and retrieval-augmented generation as well as ordered didactic information known as KA-\nRAG has shown even stronger reasoning power.The startling accuracy of 91.4 has been \ndemonstrated by KA-RAG. The proficiency of dialogue-based learning systems with KG-RAG \nhas been proven.A systematic linkage of various educational facts has been made possible by \nthe cross-domain expertise in graph design.	[-0.0045120553,0.067507304,-0.17105801,-0.07202929,0.023514498,0.002151543,0.027165724,0.026981369,-0.0043929615,0.0017388437,0.057133008,-0.015451538,0.102652386,0.025032794,-0.031917673,-0.032139316,0.006218435,-0.014398508,-0.07386746,0.056233767,-0.037129216,-0.03485351,-0.0016078606,-0.05789175,0.070627056,-0.021871408,-0.015292469,-0.05071808,-0.07134391,0.0041366937,0.0067612124,-0.0853948,-0.005065104,-0.016211694,-0.04904579,-0.011973358,0.08279983,-0.014543053,-0.029124541,-0.01143937,0.007920831,0.023926238,0.042057198,0.007741636,0.03873263,0.019887958,0.021053158,0.03104924,0.060548842,-0.055351004,-0.012136301,-0.03758872,0.030326892,0.0050361953,0.057964776,0.031226294,-0.01428797,0.040971745,0.04924627,-0.069366544,0.0663112,0.09188996,-0.09116852,0.015837152,0.02562672,-0.015882524,-0.034736633,0.08164898,-0.03502349,-0.016423356,0.048232716,-0.039332766,0.038949642,0.029463861,-0.03110921,-0.01019609,-0.014503917,-0.03799949,0.0147039145,0.08268542,0.035154488,-0.0038280855,0.058066595,-0.025928142,0.036653347,0.0023150707,-0.030447291,0.05618351,0.005212455,0.062817894,0.03976946,0.023972742,0.022115907,0.04280963,-0.07838919,0.059024617,-0.018049533,0.03487585,-0.002436361,-0.009516362,-0.038103748,-0.021460338,0.0060898103,-0.002978711,0.03484866,0.00756092,0.01834595,0.00