272	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	80	document_chunk	0	Colleges and other educational institutions often experience challenges in the reuse and \npreservation of strategic and operational decision-making knowledge. Information about past \ndecisions made by the academic and administrative staff is mostly fragmented across different \nsources, including reports, policies, emails, and the knowledge held by the staff. This has made it \ndifficult for these institutions to retain knowledge about past decisions, which has resulted in \ninconsistencies in the decision-making process. This has often come at a price, especially when \nthe key staff members depart the institution. This is often referred to as corporate amnesia. \n(Wikipedia, 2024)	[0.030259505,0.03421003,-0.17729367,-0.02349492,0.08845863,0.028713915,0.0020657913,0.0276492,0.049513925,0.060236275,0.004715698,0.004517206,0.09267481,0.028583115,0.019595413,-0.050796088,-0.036774985,-0.038805626,-0.040643908,0.04365146,-0.0025600647,-0.022603692,-0.024915982,-0.0046608495,0.023586353,0.038917087,-0.023147503,-0.04906021,-0.039714515,0.018171474,0.055122886,0.02788331,0.0465883,-0.043521434,-0.059563596,-0.06469829,0.017113544,0.011532921,0.021168511,-0.025227906,0.018293848,0.036636084,0.009230014,-0.07384453,0.059777938,0.05590827,0.031920407,-0.042809278,0.062805355,-0.04537197,0.050530408,-0.042018753,-0.0018383606,0.039934732,0.025374876,0.0007760498,0.03800496,0.06437676,0.041638345,-0.05668725,0.10405115,0.05450253,-0.015336536,0.06631455,0.03738564,-0.016713886,-0.067391396,0.053011212,-0.011026287,-0.033866853,0.040853545,0.019387104,0.019131249,0.0063602915,-0.05545139,0.008669953,-0.016092787,-0.014408967,0.010126338,0.05598113,0.037945848,-0.031125888,0.079205014,0.03022697,0.05802938,0.097490095,0.034301035,-0.026815489,0.009477219,0.099593215,-0.003301511,-0.013558122,0.030358953,0.028437283,-0.07359061,0.032817993,-0.019710785,0.008726017,-0.0698744,-0.001848519,-0.045442637,-0.050272547,-0.009331313,-0.00919463,