274	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	80	document_chunk	1	Evidence 1: 42% of Institutional Knowledge Is Unique to Each Individual \nFact: When an employee quits their peers cannot perform 42 percent of their job due to the fact \nthat such a person has a unique knowledge (Panopto, 2018) that he or she does not share with \nanybody. \nSource: surveying over 1,000 workers in the U.S. the first study of its kind to examine workplace \nknowledge and productivity reveals that half of the knowledge in institutions is individualized \nand that 12 to 15 years on average, one large enterprise is wasting $47 million in productivity \ndue to poor knowledge sharing (Panopto (n.d.), Knowledge and Productivity Workplace Report). \nThis has often come at a price, especially when the key staff members depart the institution. \n(Galdamez, 2025)	[0.02106805,0.07642246,-0.19484538,-0.00676191,0.057813488,0.019054396,0.017569715,-0.0018769829,0.050451398,0.036211498,-0.018964391,-5.0483046e-05,0.04446691,0.010838485,0.041230623,-0.016004423,0.01489985,-0.059692733,-0.01707174,0.058772855,-0.0454319,-0.016609605,-0.02824723,-0.030436706,0.038114592,0.045459326,-0.06247213,-0.043316964,-0.00855451,0.017763704,0.0047063692,0.00094295986,0.04605288,-0.03821547,-0.081342,-0.042167682,0.06937562,-0.021597063,0.020547334,-0.008128173,0.009120025,0.038897626,0.004049602,-0.063077256,0.039770976,0.015647417,0.0096280845,0.025191635,0.03453508,-0.01800224,0.0036164932,-0.011012691,-0.010446423,0.07561081,0.03747168,0.035305075,-0.05575175,0.016597865,0.062280983,-0.06159262,0.09935715,0.055083573,-0.05775592,0.068638355,0.02320687,0.02975462,-0.007512528,0.06260181,-0.0109858615,-0.014725424,-0.014283805,0.0054126806,0.028728915,0.019312715,-0.07320731,0.04751963,-0.01439567,-0.00138048,0.0025048712,0.07611137,0.06559406,-0.020544374,0.06459404,0.043603487,0.06596094,0.017421752,-0.011479329,-0.026743678,-0.024856353,0.12307917,0.02919384,0.015078063,0.028156338,0.03576081,-0.054301385,0.005436151,-0.018018994,-0.