293	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	86	document_chunk	0	1. Project Description \nThe project requires designing and developing a web-based, centralized, and decision support \nsystem for a simulated college setting. The simulated college setting comprises Operational \nAcademic Units and Parent Regulatory and Administrative Departments. The system aims at \ncapturing, storing, and reusing knowledge for decision-making in the academic and \nadministrative fields for the purpose of decision-making in the long run. The solution that has \nbeen proposed for the project is a knowledge management solution that utilizes a hybrid model \nfor knowledge management, which combines Knowledge Graph, structured databases, and \nRetrieval Augmented Generation.	[-0.014401735,0.075147465,-0.16038091,-0.039453775,0.0534339,-0.008795618,-0.017465936,0.011951408,0.019394318,0.019574836,0.03754285,-0.0032723784,0.09886724,0.02297776,-0.049681637,-0.028047433,-0.040882774,-0.03962287,-0.0377192,0.009984758,-0.007219417,-0.068793625,-0.023295673,-0.028168553,0.042633016,0.026070673,-0.026484815,-0.028168628,-0.04163111,0.031045364,0.0065537104,0.028297653,0.033045534,-0.012504102,-0.062833086,-0.07753165,0.04277133,-0.0039006043,-0.026970917,-0.02973739,-0.02950358,0.009725443,-0.017788332,-0.06293412,0.031703133,0.016065262,0.05690084,-0.040405344,0.046575,-0.024291066,0.016694924,-0.02781891,-0.0009933739,0.015829297,0.059692595,0.00687129,-0.0021204066,0.04946471,0.03912176,-0.065738276,0.111699805,0.10383846,-0.061410822,0.087681495,0.012008434,-0.031307116,-0.032431103,0.0701911,-0.038817003,-0.022522116,0.030643566,0.010416167,0.04433883,0.0046305573,-0.057408493,0.0068083736,-0.00489461,-0.041689005,0.023392128,0.056644518,0.063654006,-0.0052570067,0.06655372,-0.0066519496,0.049830157,0.029449705,-0.06118553,-0.01195551,-0.008340511,0.06370274,0.0021873983,0.027800193,0.0030422136,0.030408015,-0.060821213,0.028035866,-0.04009465,0.009249467,-0.029015683,-0.031356048,-0.033146776,-0.039196964,-0.030