338	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	100	document_chunk	1	Communication Plan: A well-organized communication system is followed by the team to \nmake sure that effective collaboration is well managed. This will consist of asynchronous \nupdates in the form of version control systems (GitHub) daily, asynchronous sprint planning in \nthe form of Google meets and WhatsApp to arrange on a daily basis and provide short-updates \nweekly, and monthly progress meetings with the Project Supervisor. \n3. Roles and Responsibilities: \nFull Name \nRoles  \nResponsibilities  \nSamrat Jwala \nUprety \nProject Lead, AI Architect \nand Backend Engineer \nBuilds the main AI logic to make the system \ngive useful and intelligent responses.  \nDevelops the primary communication channel \nbetween the user and the AI.  \nMonitors the general technical flow, and \napplication cleverness. \nRayan Tolange \nInfrastructure and DevOps \nEngineer \nMaintains databases containing all \norganization information which are organized.  \nMake sure the system is stable, secure and \nrunning without failure.  \nManages the technical infrastructure to host, \noperate and upgrade the application. \nRuby Bhuju \nLead Frontend Engineer  \nConstructs the site design, buttons and user \ndashboard.  \nMake sure that the system is simple to use \nand navigate by non-technical managers.  \nControls the method in which the users enter \ntheir questions and the way they see the \nanswers of the AI.	[-0.02843368,0.04673624,-0.16337736,-0.009815432,0.07794734,-0.036123965,0.017334297,-0.06509561,0.008586258,0.006569366,-0.0020424214,0.009851006,0.092020854,0.07777658,0.021702012,-0.017477509,0.00916329,-0.039064884,-0.051766627,0.022828726,0.0048464076,-0.049048822,0.020394718,-0.003904515,0.09092946,0.04120494,0.015036885,-0.022008454,-0.04837806,-0.03986698,0.04386352,0.02305943,0.0013385898,-0.032483127,-0.06072268,-0.07238205,0.028496407,-0.023982074,-0.01633523,-0.016518548,0.010811626,-0.0022748946,-0.009869937,-0.05035481,