k_index": 0, "document_id": 12, "page_number": 26, "decision_title": "Suspend Student for Repeat Examination Cheating"}
359	\N	12	\N	\N	\N	106	document_chunk	1	The following sections outline the mitigation strategies for the project, grouped under \nPreventive, Detective, and Corrective measures to ensure a robust and reliable system: \nTechnical & Data Integrity (R1, R2, & R3) \nTo ensure data integrity in the Knowledge Graph (KG), preventive measures are in place to use \ncurated data and perform data normalization. For detectively addressing the data, the system will \nrequire human verification of the relationships between entities and perform periodic checks to \nmaintain consistency in the data. \nIn terms of the integration complexity of KG-RAG, the strategy proposes a modular architecture \nand standard APIs to avoid any bottlenecks in integration. Continuous testing of the graph \nqueries and retrieval modules is carried out to monitor integration, and corrective actions of \nrefactoring and fallback are undertaken to ensure the system is operational in the event of \nintegration failures. In terms of the mitigation of Model Hallucination, the strategy proposes \nlimiting the generated output to the retrieved knowledge, and the use of advanced prompt \nengineering techniques is undertaken to improve accuracy. Accuracy is detected by cross-\nchecking the output with the source, and corrections are undertaken through the use of \nconfidence indicators and mandatory citations. \nPerformance, Scalability, & Retrieval (R4, R6, & R7) \nIn terms of Performance and Scalability, the scope of the system is initially limited to simulated \ndata, and optimization of indexing and queries is undertaken to ensure Performance and \nScalability. Performance benchmarking and load testing are undertaken as the primary detective \ntools, and caching and database query optimization are undertaken as corrective actions in the \nevent of any latencies in Performance and Scalability.	[0.07413083,0.01656381,-0.20763583,-0.0025382617,0.06531585,-0.04155262,0.018294599,0.0045196638,-0.013717289,0.0134